1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,380
Fold your arms.

2
00:00:01,380 --> 00:00:04,000
Now fold them the OTHER way.

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,080
Feels wrong?

4
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,551
You just switched OFF

5
00:00:06,551 --> 00:00:08,067
your autopilot.

6
00:00:08,118 --> 00:00:09,262
Switch back...

7
00:00:09,262 --> 00:00:10,010
Ahh.

8
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:10,867
Autopilot.

9
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:11,900
You've folded that way

10
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,250
thousands of times...

11
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:14,567
it flies itself.

12
00:00:14,608 --> 00:00:15,710
The other way?

13
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,310
Your brain flies it...

14
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:18,400
by hand.

15
00:00:18,455 --> 00:00:19,520
Weirdest part?

16
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,874
Identical twins...

17
00:00:20,874 --> 00:00:21,910
almost half

18
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:23,733
fold opposite ways.

19
00:00:23,761 --> 00:00:24,930
Same DNA...

20
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:26,100
different pilot.

21
00:00:26,137 --> 00:00:27,770
Now try the wrong way...

22
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:28,890
FASTER.

